    "problems": "No recovery attack or never-trained comparison is included. The paper does not state chance levels for the reported WMDP forget accuracies. No uncertainty estimates are reported in the cited results.",
    "rows_left_out": "Other Table 1 methods and WMDP/RWKU submetrics, Table 2 comparisons, and gradient-cosine measurements are not extracted here; rows focus on the paper's explicitly discussed SimNPO+GD comparison across the benchmarks.",
