    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The reader's 'tests'/T2 is wrong: no recovery attack is run, so the results speak only to method performance (T4). The reader's note that chance level is unstated is moot: WMDP is 4-choice (25%), and the Bio forget scores of 26–29 are near chance. The limits_scope label on A is removed because no version is tested. The paper's intro asserts unlearned models lack the knowledge even if jailbroken, but this is assumed, not tested."
